title Current implementation | Class lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
[*] --> published : createClass / publishClass [verified + every skill approved]
published --> in_progress : startClass
full --> in_progress : startClass
published --> completed : completion / scheduled-end sweep
full --> completed : completion / scheduled-end sweep
in_progress --> completed : completion / scheduled-end sweep
published --> cancelled : Teacher cancellation / no-show
full --> cancelled : Teacher cancellation / no-show
in_progress --> cancelled : cancellation outcome
completed --> cancelled : current cancel endpoint / markCancelled
cancelled --> [*]
state draft
note right of full
 Declared state and accepted by start/complete handlers.
 No automatic Published -> Full writer found.
end note
note right of draft
 Declared domain state.
 Current create endpoint publishes directly.
end note
note right of completed
 Completion time and basis stored.
 Domain transition table declares Completed terminal,
 but current cancel endpoint/repository permits cancellation.
 class.completed drives wallet release.
 Rating eligibility helper is not a rating API.
end note
@enduml
